{"3797250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Baiacool - Tides of Olympus", "steam_appid": 3797250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cbe51729c48cc7df691afeaeee5abec3.avif?t=1782500801\" width=617 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/395fbb343cc0af0e300d95f31b94ab66.webp?t=1782500801\" width=616 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baiacool – Tides of Olympus</strong> puts you in the skin (okay, scales) of a <strong>pufferfish</strong> on a quest to find Poseidon after receiving a cryptic message. Explore Greek god temples, solve puzzles, and fight enemies using a <strong>mystical stick</strong> (he <i>insists</i> on being called that) who just won’t shut up. Uncover who's behind all of this – by saying just one word... <strong>cool</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/049a1f16032fb82a58b72e05cc093676.poster.avif?t=1782500801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/049a1f16032fb82a58b72e05cc093676.webm?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/049a1f16032fb82a58b72e05cc093676.mp4?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1782500801\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/9cd65bfd99c42c4954549ca1086fd880.webp?t=1782500801\" width=616 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poseidon has disappeared and, by pure coincidence, several gods have suddenly taken a strong interest in the “stability” of Olympus. No one is competing for the throne, of course, just making sure it doesn’t remain... vacant... and if he isn’t found soon, the bottom of the sea may become the stage for something far less diplomatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/bf84a2badad15f176dce0eddca3d6494.poster.avif?t=1782500801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/bf84a2badad15f176dce0eddca3d6494.webm?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/bf84a2badad15f176dce0eddca3d6494.mp4?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1782500801\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/8e739cfa93c233070ea69fcead11ec68.webp?t=1782500801\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A marine adventure (that doesn’t feel like a water level) lasting 2 to 3 hours, where the entire Greek pantheon ended up at the bottom of the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that would make even Daedalus lose his cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet famous mythological characters (if Achilles were a fish, where would his heel be???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the underwater folks with their problems (always for a good reason, of course: epic rewards that probably do something cool... I think).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a bunch of outfits, weapons, and powers to prove Hecate’s not the only one pulling magical sea bunnies out of a hat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of Greek mythology  and don’t just float around clueless.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/a83b583ff852275c4c4138a768005d2b.poster.avif?t=1782500801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/a83b583ff852275c4c4138a768005d2b.webm?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/a83b583ff852275c4c4138a768005d2b.mp4?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1782500801\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cbe51729c48cc7df691afeaeee5abec3.avif?t=1782500801\" width=617 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/395fbb343cc0af0e300d95f31b94ab66.webp?t=1782500801\" width=616 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baiacool – Tides of Olympus</strong> puts you in the skin (okay, scales) of a <strong>pufferfish</strong> on a quest to find Poseidon after receiving a cryptic message. Explore Greek god temples, solve puzzles, and fight enemies using a <strong>mystical stick</strong> (he <i>insists</i> on being called that) who just won’t shut up. Uncover who's behind all of this – by saying just one word... <strong>cool</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/049a1f16032fb82a58b72e05cc093676.poster.avif?t=1782500801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/049a1f16032fb82a58b72e05cc093676.webm?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/049a1f16032fb82a58b72e05cc093676.mp4?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1782500801\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/9cd65bfd99c42c4954549ca1086fd880.webp?t=1782500801\" width=616 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poseidon has disappeared and, by pure coincidence, several gods have suddenly taken a strong interest in the “stability” of Olympus. No one is competing for the throne, of course, just making sure it doesn’t remain... vacant... and if he isn’t found soon, the bottom of the sea may become the stage for something far less diplomatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/bf84a2badad15f176dce0eddca3d6494.poster.avif?t=1782500801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/bf84a2badad15f176dce0eddca3d6494.webm?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/bf84a2badad15f176dce0eddca3d6494.mp4?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1782500801\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/8e739cfa93c233070ea69fcead11ec68.webp?t=1782500801\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A marine adventure (that doesn’t feel like a water level) lasting 2 to 3 hours, where the entire Greek pantheon ended up at the bottom of the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that would make even Daedalus lose his cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet famous mythological characters (if Achilles were a fish, where would his heel be???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the underwater folks with their problems (always for a good reason, of course: epic rewards that probably do something cool... I think).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a bunch of outfits, weapons, and powers to prove Hecate’s not the only one pulling magical sea bunnies out of a hat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of Greek mythology  and don’t just float around clueless.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/a83b583ff852275c4c4138a768005d2b.poster.avif?t=1782500801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/a83b583ff852275c4c4138a768005d2b.webm?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/a83b583ff852275c4c4138a768005d2b.mp4?t=1782500801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1782500801\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph